<title>HUNGARY: CESI ends virtually steady, ends at 1,508.32 pts.</title>
<headline>CESI ends virtually steady, ends at 1,508.32 pts.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index eased 0.93 points or 0.06 percent to end at 1,494.91 points, the Budapest Stock Exchange said on its Reuters page.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, 1996, reflects trends of 73 shares on the Budapest, Prague, Warsaw, Bratislava and Ljubljana bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
